Package: tspanels
Title: Open Panels of Related Time Series, with Margins and Exposure
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Ahmed", "Eldeeb", email = "a.eldeeb@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Loads open collections of related time series into one long
    format: a series identifier, a date, the observed value, the categorical
    margins that index the series with the attributes nested in them, and,
    where the source records one, an exposure variable: the share of each
    period during which the value could be observed, or the number of units,
    such as patients seen, it was observed among. Exposure is optional: a
    panel need not record it and a caller may drop it. Raw files come from
    their official sources, fetched where the licence permits and imported
    from the user's own download where it does not, and every file is checked
    against a recorded SHA-256 checksum. Each loader documents the decisions
    it makes in deriving the panel from the raw files.
